eakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2254263650,"text":"唉…谁知道，现在事情变成了这样。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710621210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":3657292042,"text":"关于「黑灾」…","nextNodeIds":[710621211]},{"nodeId":710621211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2807672138,"text":"或者「漆黑灾祸」，或者随便怎么称呼…五百年前的那场大灾难。","nextNodeIds":[710621212]},{"nodeId":710621212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2407545514,"text":"总之…是我们至冬人永恒的敌人，我们相信的是…五百年来，灾祸一直在潜伏着，而我们会永远保持警惕。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710621213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":3240294858,"text":"关于你们自己…","nextNodeIds":[710621214]},{"nodeId":710621214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":401491578,"text":"我们自己？有什么好说的…我们在努力战斗了，但失败了，就这么简单。","nextNodeIds":[710621215]},{"nodeId":710621215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2072004634,"text":"下来的时候我们是第九连队，六十四人。可到现在呢？包括连长在内…牺牲或失踪的可能超过一半以上，也可能不到…","nextNodeIds":[710621216]},{"nodeId":710621216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":4167379818,"text":"但大体差不多…我们都被打散了，彼此失去了联系…我们已经输了，早就该撤离了…","nextNodeIds":[710621217]},{"nodeId":710621217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":141830394,"text":"你们在地面的同僚攻击了璃月港。","nextNodeIds":[710621218]},{"nodeId":710621218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":1207320698,"text":"…很惊讶，但完全理解。","nextNodeIds":[710621219]},{"nodeId":710621219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2433037354,"text":"为了协助更有意义的冒险，「公鸡」大人自然会抛弃相对低价值的资产，这是他的理性。","nextNodeIds":[710621220]},{"nodeId":710621220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":1711327178,"text":"我们作为他的直属部下，对此完全可以接受…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710621221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":396190234,"text":"关于卡塔琳娜…","nextNodeIds":[710621222]},{"nodeId":710621222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":351634498,"text":"你遇见她了？她还活着…？我希望她能原谅我们。","nextNodeIds":[710621223]},{"nodeId":710621223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":1276056034,"text":"她和她的弟弟，尼古拉下士，都是在「壁炉之家」长大的…是女皇陛下的孩子们。","nextNodeIds":[710621224]},{"nodeId":710621224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":7627482,"text":"她和我说一定要找到弟弟才行，我以为是下面的环境搞坏了她的脑子才让她那样子出丑…她的弟弟不可能活下来了。","nextNodeIds":[710621225,710621230]},{"nodeId":710621225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":3240409258,"text":"所以你们抛弃了她？","nextNodeIds":[710621226]},{"nodeId":710621226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":3534936474,"text":"抛弃…？不，她…她是自愿要留下的。毕竟，我们中的任何人带着不必要的牵挂…只会拖慢整个队伍。","nextNodeIds":[710621227]},{"nodeId":710621227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":1416414250,"text":"毕竟我们…每一个人都要做好为众人牺牲自己，或为众人牺牲重要之人的准备…这是作为愚人众的觉悟。","nextNodeIds":[710621228]},{"nodeId":710621228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":505403218,"text":"卡佳她一定也做好了这样的觉悟，科利亚也是的。","nextNodeIds":[710621229]},{"nodeId":710621229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":4132463402,"text":"如果他们对我做出相同的事情，我也完全可以理解。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710621230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":3390575322,"text":"她的状况没你说的那么差。","nextNodeIds":[710621231]},{"nodeId":710621231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":2345514810,"text":"因为你是外人。愚人众不能也不应该对平民失态。","nextNodeIds":[710621232]},{"nodeId":710621232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":3262758858,"text":"但对于她来说，我们是家人。她也是我们的家人…曾经是的。","nextNodeIds":[710621233]},{"nodeId":710621233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20536,"speakerName":"安东","textMapHash":654081194,"text":"是她自己执意要找科利亚的…希望她能原谅我们。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7106232,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7106207","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7105802","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_NOT_RECEIVE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7106232,"initDialog":710622601,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[20536],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":71076,"showRandomTalkCount":0},